  (3301, 'B1|movie-and-theater|movie-maker', 'movie maker', 'movie maker', 'n.', 'B1', 118, 'Someone who produces or directs films for public viewing or entertainment.', 'The talented young movie maker won an Oscar for his brilliant first film.', 3300),
