  (3569, 'B1|quantities-and-containers|pitcher#2', 'Pitcher', 'pitcher', 'n.', 'B1', 126, 'A deep container used for pouring liquids easily.', 'She filled the glass pitcher with fresh lemonade and ice for the guests.', 3563),
