  (3575, 'B1|religion-and-festivals|christmas-tree', 'Christmas tree', 'christmas tree', 'n.', 'B1', 127, 'Decorated evergreen used in homes during Christmas celebration.', 'They placed beautifully wrapped gifts underneath the brightly lit Christmas tree.', 3583),
