  (6657, 'C1|dialogue-and-discourse|given-that', 'given that', 'given that', 'conj.', 'C1', 213, 'Considering a particular fact before stating opinion or judgment.', 'Given that the bridge is old and poorly maintained, it is wise to close it for repairs.', 6640),
