  (7211, 'C1|language-components|idiom', 'idiom', 'idiom', 'n.', 'C1', 227, 'Phrase with meaning different from literal meanings of individual words.', '"It''s raining cats and dogs" is an idiom that means it is raining heavily.', 7203),
